## ⚙️ Architecture & Data Flow

```text
Chrome Extension (Module 1)
      ↓
Stereo Int16 PCM @ 48000 Hz
      ↓ WebSocket (ws://localhost:8765)
vad_server.py
      ↓
AudioPreprocessor (Stereo → Mono, Downsample to 16000 Hz Float32, 512-sample frames)
      ↓
SileroVadEngine (ONNX CPU Inference)
      ↓ Frame Speech Probabilities (0.0 to 1.0)
SpeechSegmenter (Dual-Threshold Hysteresis)
      ↓
 ┌────┴────┐
 ▼         ▼
SPEECH    NON-SPEECH
 (Log)    (Discard)
```

